268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Welcome to Organic Liquid Fertilizer Producing PLC, where the only patented product in Ethiopia called Eco Green is borne! It is an honor to lead a company dedicated to transforming Ethiopian agriculture through sustainable and innovative solutions.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Eco Green was founded with a mission to provide farmers with high-quality, organic liquid and granular fertilizers that enhance productivity while preserving soil health. Our journey began in 2007 as a research initiative, driven by the need for alternatives to chemical fertilizers. After eight years of development, we launched a patented organic liquid fertilizer that is affordable, effective, and environmentally friendly. Today, we are proud to serve millions of farmers across Ethiopia, helping them achieve better yields and long-term soil sustainability.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Sustainability is at the heart of everything we do. By utilizing organic waste and advanced fermentation technology, we create products that not only nourish crops but also protect our land for future generations. We are committed to working alongside farmers, research institutions, and organizations like GIZ Ethiopia, USAID and so many others to promote sustainable farming practices.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At Eco Green, we believe that agriculture is the backbone of our nation, and empowering farmers is the key to economic growth. As we expand, our focus remains on innovation, quality, and making a meaningful impact. Thank you for your trust and support. Together, we can cultivate a greener and more prosperous future for Ethiopian agriculture.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
