/S /P
/E (Operating from its main plant located in the North Shoa Zone of the Amhara Regional State, just 69 km from Addis Ababa, Eco Green manages a nine-hectare facility with the capacity to produce up to 8 million liters annually. The company employs 130 full-time and more than 200 part-time workers with women making 55% of the workforce composition and has ambitious plans to expand production to eight million liters per year.)
